sequenceDiagram
    participant Site
    actor User
    participant Record as Record <<database>>
    actor Admin

    %% === MEMBER PROGRAM DISCOVERY ===
    Note over Site,User: PROGRAM DISCOVERY (blue)
    Site->>User: Allow calendar selection and list active programs

    User->>Record: Find programs by location, season, price, description
    activate Record
    Record-->>User: Return filtered programs
    deactivate Record

    User->>Site: Select program

    %% === SESSION FILTERING ===
    Note over User,Record: SESSION FILTERING (green)
    User->>Record: Filter by time, coach, description
    activate Record
    Record-->>User: Return filtered sessions with available capacity
    deactivate Record

    %% === REGISTRATION FLOW ===
    Note over Site,User: REGISTRATION FLOW (orange)
    User->>Site: Select and request to join session
    Site-->>User: Swim Before?

    alt Member has swum before
        User-->>Site: Yes
        Site-->>User: Great, proceed to invoice
    else Member has NOT swum before
        User-->>Site: No
        Site-->>User: Fill out and sign PDF forms
        User-->>Site: Completed forms
    end

    User-->>Site: Pay invoice online
    Site-->>User: Send welcome email, rules email, rescheduling info email

    %% === SYSTEM UPDATES ===
    Note over Site,Record: SYSTEM UPDATES (yellow)
    Site->>Record: Register user
    activate Record
    deactivate Record

    Site->>Admin: Notify of new signup
